<title>HONG KONG: Indian Oil Corp sets US$150 mln loan.</title>
<headline>Indian Oil Corp sets US$150 mln loan.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following syndicated loan issue was announced by arranger Dresdner SEA.</p>
<p>BORROWER  INDIAN OIL CORP</p>
<p> AMOUNT    US$150 MLN   TYPE	TERM LOAN</p>
<p> MARGIN    LIBOR + 18.5 MATURITY  6 MTHS    AVGE LIFE --</p>
<p> PUTS	NONE	   CALLS     NONE	LAUNCHED  01.OCT.96</p>
<p> DRAWDOWN  ONE LUMP SUM AVAIL     60 DAYS   REPLIES   15.OCT.96</p>
<p> HOME CTRY INDIA	  REPAYMENT BULLET    GOV LAW   ENGLISH</p>
<p> NOTES     PROCEEDS ARE TO BE USED FOR PURCHASE OF CRUDE OIL</p>
<p>	     AND PETROLEUM PRODUCTS</p>
<p>ARRANGERS BANQUE INDOSUEZ AND DRESDNER SOUTH EAST ASIA MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>	     SENIOR MANAGER  US$10 MLN+ 2 BP</p>
<p>	     MANAGERS	  US$3-9 MLN 1 BP</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
</text>
